    "body": "@domenic I would like to clarify the recommendations of the specification. As far as I understood correctly, the specification requires the following code: \r\n\r\n`<audio src=\"http://www.hochmuth.com/mp3/Tchaikovsky_Rococo_Var_orch.mp3\"></audio>`\r\n\r\nThere is also a line that says:\r\n\r\n> User agents may add content to the head element of the Document, or attributes to the element host element, e.g., to link to a style sheet, to provide a script, to give the document a title, or to make the media autoplay.\r\n\r\nBut it does not say the creation of a child `<source>` element for `<video>` or `<audio>`. Does the creation of a child `<source>` imply or not?",
